OL,3,GNEWSAVillage on track for two new
OL,4,Arailway stations
OL,5,
OL,6,FA village that was last served by
OL,7,Ftrains in the 1960s could be in line
OL,8,Ffor two new stations.
OL,10,FAccording to Oxfordshire County
OL,11,FCouncil, an early report suggests a
OL,12,Fpassenger station at Ardley would
OL,13,Fbenefit the growing community.
OL,15,FIt comes at the same time a rail
OL,16,Ffreight interchange is being planned
OL,17,Fclose to the village, off junction 10
OL,18,Fof the M40, that includes a terminal to
OL,19,Ftransfer goods from lorries on to
OL,20,Ftrains, as well as 6.5 million sq ft of
OL,21,Flogistics warehousing.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
