OL,3,GNEWSAVillage on track for two new
OL,4,Arailway stations
OL,5,
OL,6,FOxfordshire Railfreight Limited, the
OL,7,Forganisation behind the freight hub,
OL,8,Fsaid the scheme would "help reduce
OL,9,Fcongestion, carbon emissions and
OL,10,Fpressure on the strategic road network"
OL,11,Fbut locals fear it could lead to
OL,12,Ftraffic problems.
